msgid ""
"# Gesture Navigation\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar supports touch gestures on the map:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Swipe Up** (U): Zoom in\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Swipe Down** (D): Zoom out\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Swipe Right** (R): Previous screen mode\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Swipe Left** (L): Next screen mode\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Up-Down** (UD): Auto zoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Down-Up** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Down-Right** (DR): Waypoint details\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Down-Left** (DL): Alternates\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Left-Up** (LU): Recently used waypoints\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Right-Down** (RD): Task manager\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Up-Right-Down** (URD): Analysis\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Left-Down-Right** (LDR): Checklist\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Up-Right-Down-Left** (URDL): Pan mode\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Left-Down-Right-Down-Left** (LDRDL): Status\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Up-Left-Down-Right** (ULDR): Quick menu\n"
"\n"
"Long-press on the map to enter Pan mode. Tap while in Pan mode to see nearby waypoints."
msgstr ""
"# Navigácia gestami\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar podporuje dotyková gesta na mapě:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Potiahnuť nahoru** (U): Priblížiť\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Potiahnuť dolô** (D): Oddialiť\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Potiahnuť doprava** (R): Predchádzajúci režim obrazovky\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Potiahnuť doleva** (L): Ďalší režim obrazovky\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Nahoru-dolô** (UD): Automatický zoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Dolô-nahoru** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Dolô-doprava** (DR): Podrobnosti bodu\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Dolô-doleva** (DL): Záložní\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Doleva-nahoru** (LU): Nedávno použité body\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Doprava-dolô** (RD): Správce úloh\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Nahoru-doprava-dolô** (URD): Analýza\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Doleva-dolô-doprava** (LDR): Kontrolný zoznam\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Nahoru-doprava-dolô-doleva** (URDL): Režim Pan\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Doleva-dolô-doprava-dolô-doleva** (LDRDL): Stav\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Nahoru-doleva-dolô-doprava** (ULDR): Rychlé menu\n"
"\n"
"Dlouhým stlačením mapy vstúpite do režimu Pan. Ťuknutým v režimu Pan zobrazíte blízke body trate."

msgid "Please enter four letters or digits only (ICAO station code)."
msgstr "Zadejte iba čtyři písmená alebo číslice (kód stanice ICAO)."

msgid "Updating repository"
msgstr "Aktualizácia repozitára"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Signed countdown until the start gate opens or closes (now). Value colour and secondary line reflect gate state at the current time: Waiting (blue), Open (green), Closed (red). PEV window overrides task gate when set."
msgstr ""
"Odpočítavanie se znamienkom do otvorenie alebo zatvorenia štartovej brány "
"(nyní). Farba hodnoty a druhý riadok odzrkadľujú stav brány: Čakanie "
"(modrá), Otvoríno (zelená), Zatvorené (červená). Okno PEV při nastavenie "
"prepísáva bránu úlohy."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Same gate as Start open. Main value is estimated time to reach the start line (MacCready leg when available, else distance / ground speed). Value colour and secondary line reflect gate state at that ETA: Too early (blue), Can start (green), Too late (red)."
msgstr ""
"Rovnaká brána jako Start open. Hlavná hodnota je odhadovaný čas k štartovej "
"čiare (noha MacCready, inak vzdialenosť / rýchlosť voči zemi). Farba a druhý"
" riadok odzrkadľujú stav brány při tomto ETA: Príliš skoro (modrá), Možno "
"startovat (zelená), Príliš neskoro (červená)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Home waypoint name, arrival altitude difference relative to the safety arrival height, and distance. Click to change the home waypoint."
msgstr ""
"Názov domáceho bodu, rozdiel výšky príletu voči bezpečnej výške príletu a "
"vzdialenosť. Ťuknutým zmeníte domáci bod."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Logger pressure altitude when the device provides it (igc_pressure_altitude), otherwise ISA pressure altitude only (1013.25 hPa; not QNH-corrected). Does not show barometric AMSL or GPS height — use other InfoBoxes for navigation."
msgstr ""
"Tlaková výška zapisovača, ak ji zariadení poskytuje (igc_pressure_altitude),"
" inak iba tlaková výška ISA (1013,25 hPa; bez korekcie QNH). Nezobrazuje "
"barometrickú AMSL ani výšku GPS — pro navigaci použite iné InfoBoxy."

